<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Timken rated neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Timken rated neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said analyst Heather Fargis initiated coverage of Timken Co with a neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/4 to 53-1/4 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- analyst declined to comment.</p>
